<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-505580-1"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-505580-1')">1</a>. If this was intentionally rigged and reading the linked tale (or knowing more history) should confirm that it's the likely case with Weber, I'm sorry.</div>
</div>

